magic
tech tiny
magscale 1 2
timestamp 1000
<< polysilicon >>
rect 0 0 10 20
rect 10 0 20 4
<< metal1 >>
rect -4 -4 24 24
tri 0 30 10 40 s
<< labels >>
rlabel metal1 0 0 4 4 1 IN
port 1 nsew signal input
